<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">Two teams agree on the technical options but disagree on who should absorb the migration risk. Both can provide evidence. Someone still needs authority to choose an owner and a deadline.</p>

<!-- @before The Escalation Template :: staff -->
### Bring a decision and the cost of waiting

State the decision, the affected groups and the consequence of delaying it. Record which alternatives the teams already considered. Ask the approver to choose a path and name what evidence would reopen it. [Atlassian DACI decision roles](https://www.atlassian.com/team-playbook/plays/daci).
